{"script":"yd_011_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]{myName}也很在意缇莎身上的结晶吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]唉？你说很好看？和缇莎很配～？嘻嘻，缇莎都不好意思啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]不过，以前好多人都觉得这些结晶和缇莎都很可怕呢。[r]缇莎小时候，好多人说缇莎是怪胎，很恶心，还都来欺负缇莎呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]但妈妈保护了缇莎，把那些家伙都教训了一顿。[r]妈妈告诉缇莎，这些都是因为缇莎体内的“魔力外泄”才出现的。[r]意思就是说，缇莎其实超级厉害！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎刚开始也不喜欢这些麻烦的结晶，但有了妈妈的保护，缇莎觉得这些结晶也没那么讨人厌了。现在加上{myName}也很喜欢，缇莎更开心啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]你看，缇莎的尾巴也有结晶哦！想要摸摸看吗？[r]是{myName}的话，缇莎一点都不介意哦！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎-亲密1"}